    "description": "Level 2: the same single-lane cross aisle with NO passing bay - three capacity-1 waypoints between a west and an east storage area. The only way to resolve a head-on meeting is for one unit to reverse out of the aisle entirely. Punishes 'never retreat' routers: they gridlock on the middle waypoints and deliver zero. Yielding costs one unit four steps and saves the whole case."
